    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24952" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">irrepto</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inr-</span></b> ), āre, v. n. and
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a.</i> [id.],
				<i>to creep into</i> or <i>to</i> a
			place, <i>to creep</i> or <i>crawl
			upon</i> (<b>poet.</b>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> With <i>dat.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nemus Lycurgo,</span>”
				<i>cover</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 4, 386</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">umeris avi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. S.
					3, 177</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			With <i>acc.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mycenas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 11, 731</span></i>
			.</div>
